OL,3,GNEWSASnow-clearing tractors added to
OL,4,Agritter fleet
OL,5,
OL,6,FMini tractors will be deployed in North
OL,7,FYorkshire's towns this winter to keep
OL,8,Fthe county moving during bad weather.
OL,10,FThe compact machines will be used in
OL,11,Furban areas which are difficult to
OL,12,Faccess by larger vehicles, to clear
OL,13,Froads and paths during challenging
OL,14,Fweather conditions.
OL,16,FNorth Yorkshire Council said they would
OL,17,Finitially be tasked with trimming
OL,18,Fflower beds and hedges, as well as
OL,19,Fcarrying fencing supplies, but were
OL,20,Ffitted with snow-clearing attachments
OL,21,Fto provide assistance to the gritting
OL,22,Ffleet.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
